{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Sync Diagrams List",
  "description": "Manually trigger to scan public/ for SVG files and update README.md and index.html with the current list of diagrams.",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "userTriggered"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Scan the public/ directory for all .svg files. Then:\\n1. Update README.md: regenerate the full list under the \\\"## Diagrams\\\" section. Each entry should be `- [Project Name](./public/filename.svg)` where the project name is derived from the filename (remove .svg extension, replace hyphens/underscores with spaces, title case it).\\n2. Update public/index.html: find the `const diagrams = [...]` array and regenerate it with all SVG files as `{ file: 'filename.svg', name: 'Project Name' }` entries where the name is derived from the filename (remove .svg, replace hyphens/underscores with spaces, title case)."
  }
}